;Proteoliposome sample. Act-EaCDCLL + act-EaCDCLS (1:2 molar ratio) were added to liposomes to yield a final sample with a liposome concentration of 3.95 mM and a 1:500 protein:lipid molar ratio. Sample was incubated at 37 degrees for 15 - 20 min before applying to grids.
